+/// The room a cluster `j` ending the line `c0..=j` may take past the margin: what the marks squeeze
+/// (`squeeze`, or a grid hang), or for a mark that may hang whole, that beside what the marks
+/// before it squeeze. After automatic spaces on a justified mode-15 line (F55) the mark's inked
+/// half must fit with what they give up, or the mark hangs whole with less from them, or not at
+/// all.
+fn end_room(pl: &ParaLayout, (c0, j): (usize, usize), squeeze: f32, overflow: f32) -> f32 {
+    if overflow <= 0.0 {
+        return squeeze;
+    }
+    let before = pl.squeeze_room(c0, j);
+    match pl.digit_hang(c0, j) {
+        Some(h) => (squeeze + h.half).max(h.whole.map_or(0.0, |w| before + overflow + w)),
+        None => (before + overflow).max(squeeze),
+    }
+}
+
